<title>USA: Apple Orthodontix stake cut by Greenblatt.</title>
<headline>Apple Orthodontix stake cut by Greenblatt.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including investor Joel Greenblatt on Friday said it reduced its stake in Apple Orthodontix Inc's outstanding common shares to 4.62 percent, or 294,900 shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, members of the group said they sold 55,100 shares in transactions on June 4 and June 5 at $11.27 and $12.08 each.</p>
</text>
